00:22:39.010 --> 00:22:40.750
And then they return after the war.

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:43.450
So there was a Jewish population

00:22:43.450 --> 00:22:48.010
that hadn't experienced
persecution in France itself,

00:22:48.010 --> 00:22:51.530
numerous and willing to speak.

00:22:51.530 --> 00:22:52.440
In addition to that,

00:22:52.440 --> 00:22:55.140
