camp and war memorials and novels films,

00:31:32.870 --> 00:31:35.460
Catholic Jewish dialogue surprisingly,

00:31:35.460 --> 00:31:37.970
that we had not thought
to explore previously.

00:31:37.970 --> 00:31:40.110
Now he's discussed some
of this for us today

00:31:40.110 --> 00:31:41.850
and given us much food for thought.

00:31:41.850 --> 00:31:45.650
So I hope we can follow
up with and ask him more

00:31:45.650 --> 00:31:49.273
