but I don't know that for a fact.

00:53:18.080 --> 00:53:20.100
It's what I suspect, but I don't know

00:53:20.939 --> 00:53:22.139
cause I didn't study it.

00:53:23.120 --> 00:53:26.140
The mentioning of Jews,
a good cases is here.

00:53:26.140 --> 00:53:27.970
It's not a local, well it's local.

00:53:27.970 --> 00:53:30.430
It's now a major national memorial too.

00:53:30.430 --> 00:53:31.670
It had right away.

00:53:31.670 --> 00:53:36.300
This is the Jewish home,
