00:53:58.280 --> 00:54:00.000
which is located some distance away

00:54:00.000 --> 00:54:03.220
where they talk about
who the killers were,

00:54:03.220 --> 00:54:07.470
who the people who saved children
and who the children were

00:54:07.470 --> 00:54:09.850
who died that they were Jewish children.

00:54:09.850 --> 00:54:13.020
And so I think that, and a good,
I'll give you another good,

00:54:13.020 --> 00:54:15.144
it's not exactly a local,

00:54:15.144 --> 00:54:16.040
I'm sorry I'm dodging the question,

00:54:16.040 --> 00:54:18.380
but this is more in line
of what you said Maurice.

00:54:18.380 --> 00:54:20.910
There's an Auschwitz
