hundreds of thousands of Jews
come because of decolonization

00:57:34.410 --> 00:57:38.040
and are now the, you
know, the biggest segment

00:57:38.040 --> 00:57:39.640
of the French Jewish population.

00:57:42.620 --> 00:57:45.960
- I don't know if you remember
our exchange, Carolyn, Maury.

