I have a feeling got another
sharp audience on our hands.

00:57:53.310 --> 00:57:57.300
You know, I really focus
in, and it's a blind spot.

00:57:57.300 --> 00:57:58.320
I fear it is.

00:57:58.320 --> 00:58:01.913
I mean, I focus on the Ashkenazi community

00:58:01.913 --> 00:58:05.570
into the 1960s in the way in which

00:58:05.570 --> 00:58:07.040
it's very much transformed

00:58:07.040 --> 00:58:09.090
by the arrival of North African Jews

00:58:09.090 --> 00:58:12.480
that doesn't figure in my
story and maybe it should.

00:58:12.480 --> 00:58:15.740
And then it's something that I've missed

00:58:15.740 --> 00:58:17.980
inflexed the story or shapes it,

00:58:17.980 --> 00:58:20.757
or rewrites it in surprising way.

00:58:22.480 --> 00:58:26.944
I need to be persuaded,
is the way I would put it.

00:58:26.944 --> 00:58:30.300
I don't wanna be skeptical,

00:58:30.300 --> 00:58:34.990
but it may be more like, I
should be careful what I say.

00:58:34.990 --> 00:58:38.110
The way in which the civil
war in the United States

00:58:38.110 --> 00:58:42.000
is part of my memory, but I wasn't here.

00:58:42.000 --> 00:58:45.120
Had nor were any of my
ancestors when it happened.

00:58:45.120 --> 00:58:49.700
And I wondered if it's not the
same thing for smarty Jews.

00:58:49.700 --> 00:58:51.510
Of course there are some, I mean,

00:58:51.510 --> 00:58:55.233
one of Shearson his right-hand
man is Vidala Modi Yano.

00:58:57.046 --> 00:58:58.147
And I write about Modi
Yano's (indistinct),

00:59:01.743 --> 00:59:03.107
the novelist Modi Yano's work

00:59:03.107 --> 00:59:06.570
and they have sparty background as well.

00:59:06.570 --> 00:59:08.583
But they're part of the
story and I don't know

00:59:08.583 --> 00:59:12.070
that they have bring a
distinctive something.

00:59:12.070 --> 00:59:14.960
- I wonder if you could
argue that they liberated

00:59:14.960 --> 00:59:17.700
a certain way of being Jewish and France

00:59:17.700 --> 00:59:21.303
and that that enabled the
Ashkenazi's to be more--

00:59:21.303 --> 00:59:24.802
- That I don't buy because
the Ashkenazi Schneerson,

00:59:24.802 --> 00:59:26.890
he doesn't need anyone to liberate.

00:59:26.890 --> 00:59:28.920
- He doesn't need any liberation.

00:59:28.920 --> 00:59:32.060
- He's a feisty character in, you know,

00:59:32.060 --> 00:59:35.370
ready to put up his dukes, or even Julie.

00:59:35.370 --> 00:59:37.104
Zack is a good case in point.

00:59:37.104 --> 00:59:42.104
He's a classic native born Jew

00:59:42.200 --> 00:59:44.923
who's not particularly
interested in his Judaism,

00:59:46.070 --> 00:59:49.820
but an educator interested
in Republican schooling.

00:59:49.820 --> 00:59:53.150
But the experience of the
war where he has to go

00:59:53.150 --> 00:59:56.530
into hiding, one of his
children is in the resistance,

00:59:56.530 --> 00:59:59.440
his wife and daughter are
deported and murdered,

00:59:59.440 --> 01:00:01.960
another kid is deported and comes back

01:00:01.960 --> 01:00:06.960
and he is full of polemic, and
he's not holding back at all

01:00:07.650 --> 01:00:10.540
and he doesn't need an influx of anybody

01:00:11.560 --> 01:00:13.860
to help him decide to stand up

01:00:13.860 --> 01:00:17.000
for what he sees needs standing up for.

01:00:17.000 --> 01:00:19.190
And this in the late 1940s.

01:00:19.190 --> 01:00:24.190
So it's not as though, and
he's writing (indistinct)

01:00:24.240 --> 01:00:25.073
once again.

01:00:25.073 --> 01:00:28.300
He's writing it starting
under the occupation,

01:00:28.300 --> 01:00:30.360
while his family is being murdered,

01:00:30.360 --> 01:00:32.300
not completing it after the war,

01:00:32.300 --> 01:00:34.550
publishing it and then going toe to toe

01:00:34.550 --> 01:00:37.350
with Catholic clerics for years on end.

01:00:37.350 --> 01:00:39.050
And in fact, it's he's the one,

01:00:39.050 --> 01:00:43.690
well I'm doing this, who
talks to John the 23rd

01:00:43.690 --> 01:00:45.940
and says, when Vatican II happens,

01:00:45.940 --> 01:00:48.683
you have to put this on the dock.

01:00:49.800 --> 01:00:52.950
And the Pope says, you know
what, I'm gonna do that.

01:00:52.950 --> 01:00:53.783
And he did it.

